#: kcmtaskbar.cpp:249
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<h1>Taskbar</h1> You can configure the taskbar here. This includes options "
"such as whether or not the taskbar should show all windows at once or only "
"those on the current desktop. You can also configure whether or not the "
"Window List button will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Линија со задачи</h1> such as whether or not the taskbar "
"should be embedded in the panel or float outside (default: embedded).  You "
"can also configure whether or not the taskbar should show all windows at "
"once or only those on the current desktop"

